      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{由公式}v_{k}=E(X^{*})=\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}x^{k}f(x)dx=\\int_{0}^{1}x^{k}(0.5x)dx,\\\\&amp;\\text{原点矩}v_{1}=\\int_{0}^{2}x(0.5x)dx=\\frac{1}{2}\\int_{0}^{2}x^{2}dx=\\frac{1}{2}\\times \\frac{1}{3}x^{3}|_{0}^{2}=\\frac{4}{3},\\\\&amp;v_{2}=\\int_{0}^{2}x^{2}(0.5x)dx=\\frac{1}{2}\\int_{0}^{2}x^{3}dx=\\frac{1}{2}\\times \\frac{1}{4}x^{4}|_{0}^{2}=2,\\\\&amp;v_{3}=\\int_{0}^{2}x^{3}(0.5x)dx=\\frac{1}{2}\\times \\frac{1}{5}x^{3}|_{0}^{2}=3.2,\\\\&amp;v_{4}=\\int_{0}^{2}x^{4}(0.5x)dx=\\frac{1}{2}\\times \\frac{1}{6}x^{6}|_{0}^{2}=\\frac{16}{3};\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{由公式}v_{k}=E(X^{*})=\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}x^{k}f(x)dx=\\int_{0}^{1}x^{k}(0.5x)dx,\\\\&amp;\\text{原点矩}v_{1}=\\int_{0}^{2}x(0.5x)dx=\\frac{1}{2}\\int_{0}^{2}x^{2}dx=\\frac{1}{2}\\times \\frac{1}{3}x^{3}|_{0}^{2}=\\frac{4}{3},\\\\&amp;v_{2}=\\int_{0}^{2}x^{2}(0.5x)dx=\\frac{1}{2}\\int_{0}^{2}x^{3}dx=\\frac{1}{2}\\times \\frac{1}{4}x^{4}|_{0}^{2}=2,\\\\&amp;v_{3}=\\int_{0}^{2}x^{3}(0.5x)dx=\\frac{1}{2}\\times \\frac{1}{5}x^{3}|_{0}^{2}=3.2,\\\\&amp;v_{4}=\\int_{0}^{2}x^{4}(0.5x)dx=\\frac{1}{2}\\times \\frac{1}{6}x^{6}|_{0}^{2}=\\frac{16}{3};\\end{aligned}</div>"
